whispr (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Push-to-talk dictation with faster-whisper GPU transcription.
  * Punctuation and editing voice commands.
  * Domain-specific vocabulary corrections and expansions.
  * System tray integration with PyQt6.
  * Optional local LLM cleanup via Ollama.
  * First-run setup wizard with model download.
  * Vocabulary import from Excel, CSV, JSON.

 -- Whispr Developers <whispr@localhost>  Sat, 28 Mar 2026 23:00:00 +0000
